Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I'm doing now is\Nnothing more than a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.22,0:01:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you. You are always a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.38,0:01:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to have a dream,\Nbut I'm not going to have a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.52,0:01:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to have a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.43,0:01:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to have a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.58,0:01:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to have to be a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.49,0:01:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.30,0:01:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wizardmon, a long-time friend of Gatomon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.54,0:01:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was able to make her remember that she\Nwas to be the Digimon of the Eighth Child,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.40,0:01:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who turned out to be\Nmy little sister, Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.92,0:01:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatomon had been waiting in\Nthe Digi-World for a long time,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.80,0:01:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and when Kari didn't show up,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.44,0:01:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Myotismon took her under his grizzly\Nwing and convinced her that she was evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.46,0:01:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our new friends then tried to get\Nthe true crest from Myotismon's lair.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.20,0:01:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he surprised them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.30,0:02:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good news is, he didn't know\Nthat Kari was the 8th child.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.66,0:02:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bad news is, he's using\NGatomon to find out who he is.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.69,0:02:14.98,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fs30\b1}The Fairy of Odaiba! Lilimon Blooms
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.98,0:02:17.28,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Traffic Information
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.98,0:02:17.28,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Beware of fog
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.98,0:02:17.28,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Speed limit 30 MPH
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.76,0:02:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Due to the continuing heavy fog, we'll\Nbe experiencing some delays up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.24,0:02:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please bear with us
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.82,0:02:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost done.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.88,0:02:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon now not in fire or ice, but\Nin fog this world will be mine
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.50,0:02:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this soil is polluted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.24,0:02:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gasoline and old candy wrappers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.56,0:03:00.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got this bottled water.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.90,0:03:01.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.81,0:03:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fresh and pure as a winter\Nmorning in the Swiss Alps.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.78,0:03:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.08,0:03:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least that's what\Nit says on the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.36,0:03:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, pour it on my roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.38,0:03:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.70,0:03:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yummy, you ladybug.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.66,0:03:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hush!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.66,0:03:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi? Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.22,0:03:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, what are you doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.22,0:03:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hi, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.20,0:03:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.84,0:03:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you see, I was just waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.86,0:03:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.28,0:03:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Dad, why are you so late, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.08,0:03:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's this fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.20,0:03:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's got everything tied up in knots.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.08,0:03:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, what's that you got\Nunder your hat there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.10,0:03:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just, uh, uh, ooh,\Nbirds getting cold out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.92,0:03:58.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we'd better hurry up and\Nget home or Mom will be worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.64,0:04:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, honey. Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.32,0:04:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.23,0:04:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have pretended you were my\Ndoll or a stuffed animal, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.84,0:04:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I have a reputation\Nfor good taste to maintain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.86,0:04:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in bad taste?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.08,0:04:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what you're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.82,0:04:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Palmon, I didn't mean it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.10,0:04:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.50,0:04:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made this dish up myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.18,0:04:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I call it shrimp fried rice\Nwith whipped cream and strawberries.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.80,0:04:27.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.98,0:04:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've really outdone\Nyourself this time, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.92,0:04:31.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.83,0:04:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so glad you like it. You\Nmean it? I mean it. Really? Really.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.63,0:04:40.55,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Cram school
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.78,0:04:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I got a C.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.18,0:04:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There goes med school,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.44,0:04:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and my dad wanted me to call right\Naway and tell him my grades. A C?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.90,0:04:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget about my oldest mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.40,0:04:48.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a real disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.00,0:04:50.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.91,0:04:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clearly, this grade is the result of\Nall the stress from the monster attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.30,0:04:57.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you can't get into\Nmedical school, I'd try politics.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.54,0:04:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.00,0:05:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a break. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.16,0:05:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw man...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.20,0:05:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right when it was about\Nto get to the best part.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.66,0:05:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on, Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.22,0:05:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.13,0:05:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just coming to get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.48,0:05:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole system's gone down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.24,0:05:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Transmitters, satellite\Nfeed, the whole shebang.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.72,0:05:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.63,0:05:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's a systems glitch, it's like\Nthe Godzilla of all systems glitches,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.72,0:05:35.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we can't even check it out\Nbecause communications are down, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.36,0:05:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like the end of\Nthe world or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.94,0:05:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one will escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.72,0:05:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one, not even the eighth child.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.74,0:06:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Due to a system failure, all trains will
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.28,0:06:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be delayed indefinitely\Nwe apologize for the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.88,0:06:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,inconvenience the pay\Nphones don't work either
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.32,0:06:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what's going on everything's falling apart
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.44,0:06:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it could be worse we could\Nbe stuck on the train
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.74,0:06:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything started going\Nwonky ever since that fog
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.44,0:06:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Came in. Even my cell phone\Nisn't working. Of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.78,0:06:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it wasn't working before,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.32,0:06:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but still Hey, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.44,0:06:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To earn my pay. To investigate\Nthis thing. That's what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.86,0:06:34.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,after all We'll come with you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.22,0:06:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe in yourself Say\Nit I believe in me Good
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.28,0:06:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tai Do you think Gato Mom's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.64,0:06:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure she is, Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.94,0:06:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First thing tomorrow, we'll go find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.68,0:06:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.59,0:06:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we had better go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.18,0:06:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll need our rest to fight my Otis Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.46,0:06:59.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't want to fall asleep\Non the job, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.62,0:07:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.84,0:07:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You scared, Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.96,0:07:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.52,0:07:08.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Atta girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.52,0:07:09.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave everything to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.90,0:07:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm dying my clothes pink again. Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.12,0:07:17.58,Sign,,0,0,50,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord0\fr16\c&H5E5E5E&\fs40}To Dad
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.12,0:07:17.58,Sign,,220,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord0\fr16\c&H5E5E5E&\fs20}There's boiled mackerel
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.12,0:07:17.58,Sign,,290,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord0\fr16\c&H5E5E5E&\fs20}in the fridge
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.12,0:07:17.58,Sign,,350,0,450,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord0\fr20\c&H5E5E5E&\fs20}underwear in the laundry
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.46,0:07:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like Dad's working late again.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.58,0:07:24.00,Sign,,0,0,50,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord0\fr16\c&H5E5E5E&\fs40}To Dad
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.58,0:07:24.00,Sign,,220,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord0\fr16\c&H5E5E5E&\fs20}There's boiled mackerel
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.58,0:07:24.00,Sign,,290,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord0\fr16\c&H5E5E5E&\fs20}in the fridge
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.58,0:07:24.00,Sign,,350,0,450,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord0\fr20\c&H5E5E5E&\fs20}underwear in the laundry
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.04,0:07:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something weird's going on.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.00,0:07:27.00,Sign,,0,300,150,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Beware of Heavy Fog
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.00,0:07:27.00,Sign,,0,300,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Do Not Pass
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.08,0:07:24.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.99,0:07:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are doing our job, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.74,0:07:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.20,0:07:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fog's disrupting our entire area.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.88,0:07:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why isn't any other\Npart of town seeing fog?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.68,0:07:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like some alien power's controlling\Nthe fog bank with magic or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.96,0:07:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.87,0:07:40.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop trying to scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.28,0:07:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.40,0:07:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what's that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.24,0:07:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,keep it down you both saw it good at least\Ni know i'm not the only one going crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.12,0:08:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what's the connection somehow the fog's\Ntied in with these monsters we keep seeing
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.48,0:08:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let the humans scream it\Ndoesn't bother us we travel
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.75,0:08:16.09,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Gizamon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.75,0:08:16.09,Sign,,370,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Child
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.75,0:08:16.09,Sign,,370,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.75,0:08:16.09,Sign,,370,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Aquatic Mammal Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.75,0:08:16.09,Sign,,370,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.75,0:08:16.09,Sign,,370,0,348,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Spiral Edge
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.16,0:08:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in packs creating terror\Nwhether on land or underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.36,0:08:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, get in the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.58,0:08:28.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An impenetrable fog has sealed\Noff the main district of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.18,0:08:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incoming reports also verify\Nthat all communication
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.48,0:08:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,systems appear to have\Nbeen rendered useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.14,0:08:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, Matt. TK!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.54,0:08:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.46,0:08:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.16,0:08:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever happens, they'll need me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.74,0:08:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-mm. Oh, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.90,0:08:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt is there, and so is Dad.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.04,0:08:50.00,Sign,,400,0,250,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1\fs30\i1}Odaiba Disaster
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.04,0:08:50.00,Sign,,400,0,250,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1\fs30\i1}A Fog Barrier!?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.98,0:08:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't just leave them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.46,0:08:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then. We'll go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.32,0:08:56.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get your coat, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.18,0:08:58.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.34,0:09:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wake up, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.58,0:09:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get up and get dressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.26,0:09:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.60,0:09:06.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad, what happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.40,0:09:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.48,0:09:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just get up and get dressed, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.94,0:09:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.84,0:09:17.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Down to the pier.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.75,0:09:19.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we can get in by boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.52,0:09:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An announcement will be made\Nwhen service has been restored.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.34,0:09:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We apologize for any inconvenience.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.92,0:09:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world is that thing?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.88,0:09:37.18,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Phantomon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.88,0:09:37.18,Sign,,370,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.88,0:09:37.18,Sign,,370,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.88,0:09:37.18,Sign,,370,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Ghost Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.88,0:09:37.18,Sign,,370,0,305,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.88,0:09:37.18,Sign,,370,0,345,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Soul Chopper
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.68,0:09:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Phantomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.38,0:09:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't want to be\Nnear me or my frightening
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.50,0:09:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,little friends when I start\Nto swing my shadow side.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.44,0:09:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Otifman requests your presence,\Nand he won't take no for an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.84,0:09:55.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you really going to\Nsoccer practice today?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.94,0:10:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai will be there, and I really need to\Ntalk to him about our plan of attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.20,0:10:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I could use the practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.96,0:10:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.04,0:10:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to soccer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.96,0:10:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.16,0:10:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll see you in a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.56,0:10:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.72,0:10:15.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The phone's still out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.72,0:10:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, your poor father.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.44,0:10:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope he's not stuck in the subway.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.56,0:10:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not watching that video again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.66,0:10:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The TV's still out, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.48,0:10:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder who'd be dropping\Nby unannounced. Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.80,0:10:32.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.71,0:10:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.54,0:10:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.68,0:10:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Come on! Tai! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.96,0:11:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run! This way! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.10,0:11:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, we're all safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.72,0:11:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, honey, what are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.54,0:11:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a long story, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.62,0:11:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, Twister!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.34,0:11:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just talked. I saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.62,0:11:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you were a stuffed animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.82,0:11:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, life's full of surprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.78,0:11:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the soccer field?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.00,0:11:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's down at the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.64,0:11:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.00,0:11:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you need to know\Nis, Zora's in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.48,0:11:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.38,0:11:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll start by separating the\Nchildren from their parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.54,0:11:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, how they'll scream\Nand weep. Delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.36,0:11:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you're not as powerful here in\Nthe real world as you thought you'd be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.58,0:11:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Power isn't anything I'd concern\Nmyself with if I were you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.76,0:11:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,especially since you don't have any.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.96,0:11:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.06,0:11:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now will you tell me what happened, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.02,0:12:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hardly know myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.82,0:12:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I want you to stay here, out of sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.02,0:12:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.10,0:12:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The station.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.01,0:12:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to try to find some way to communicate\Nwith the outside world, smoke signals,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.08,0:12:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.10,0:12:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be safe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.72,0:12:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay with Gokimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.82,0:12:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you know about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.74,0:12:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, Dad, how? Never\Nmind how. Just be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.02,0:12:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I think he likes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.22,0:12:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gokimon, digivolve to...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.36,0:12:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.22,0:12:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Another monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.72,0:12:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.00,0:12:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This monster's on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.92,0:12:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get my mom, Greymon. Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.78,0:12:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shadow side!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.20,0:12:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Greymon, it looks\Nlike your time is up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.72,0:12:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get the rest of the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.24,0:12:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.50,0:12:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nova Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.00,0:12:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Tai, I'm losing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.22,0:12:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll get your mom later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.84,0:12:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, we've got to\Nget out of here. Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.86,0:12:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom, you'll be there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.02,0:13:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cory! Tai!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.36,0:13:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll follow them and find\Nout where they've taken her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.72,0:13:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But will it work?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.02,0:13:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.58,0:13:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.74,0:13:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, Mimi, they got you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.40,0:13:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can digivolve any\Ntime. Just say the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.64,0:13:22.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's too many people\Nand too many of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.42,0:13:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see how this plays out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.24,0:13:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be our trump card for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.58,0:13:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.49,0:13:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.62,0:13:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stand not knowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.00,0:13:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.91,0:13:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can I calm down?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.04,0:13:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For all we know, that monster's\Ndevoured the children by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.88,0:13:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, he's one of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.78,0:13:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a lot more where he came\Nfrom We've got some powerful friends
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.36,0:13:43.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.28,0:13:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we've got Truth and justice and all\Nthat good stuff On our side Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.26,0:13:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you can't beat him, join him Now\Nlet's go inside and find Sora Right Wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.72,0:13:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this may be a strange question But\Ndid Sora ever say Did she tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.70,0:14:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,does Sora hate me? What? Oh boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.60,0:14:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you have it wrong Then\NI realized I was worried
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.60,0:14:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about you just the way my\Nmother worries about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.44,0:14:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now I know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.76,0:14:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mom loved me all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.60,0:14:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it was your love that helped\Nme digivolve, Sora. I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.72,0:14:17.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.56,0:14:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could it be worse?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.98,0:14:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could work for minimum wage in a foam
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.84,0:14:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rubber suit with kids\Nkicking you all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.86,0:14:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.77,0:14:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.84,0:14:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it, Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.60,0:14:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't stay in this\Nplace one second longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.68,0:14:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you've been wanting to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.16,0:14:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at this as a vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.40,0:14:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who asked you to talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.70,0:14:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, children.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.64,0:14:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to yell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.78,0:14:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just that I'm not used to being held\Ncaptive by creatures from another world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.14,0:14:48.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.05,0:14:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.98,0:14:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't want to get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.60,0:14:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to go home and sleep in my own bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.50,0:14:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to live life to the fullest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.14,0:14:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to clean lint out of my dryer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.04,0:14:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to pick up after my doggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.80,0:15:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to know what's\Nhappening on my self-operative.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.02,0:15:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad I got that off my chest Enough\Nof this, we need a plan Yeah, Jeremiah,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.06,0:15:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why don't you help us\Ninstead of listening to those
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.94,0:15:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mind Over Matter tapes all\Nthe time What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.64,0:15:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only way to weaken Bakemon is with\NMind Over Matter Huh? Mind Over what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.90,0:15:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an old Roman technique\NYou repeat a phrase over and
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.92,0:15:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,over again and it helps you\Nfocus your mind What's that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.38,0:15:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just do what she says, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.52,0:15:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Half of you come with me Let's get em!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.16,0:15:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Women and children, follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.64,0:15:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fuck the volume!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.22,0:15:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, lose your power!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.32,0:15:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.60,0:15:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're safe at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.80,0:16:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spoke too soon!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:00.52,0:16:08.73,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}DarkTyranomon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:00.52,0:16:08.73,Sign,,370,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:16:00.52,0:16:08.73,Sign,,370,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:16:00.52,0:16:08.73,Sign,,370,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Dinosaur Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:16:00.52,0:16:08.73,Sign,,370,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:16:00.52,0:16:08.73,Sign,,370,0,348,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Fire Blast
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.74,0:16:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Dark Tyrannomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.38,0:16:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was actually a nice guy once until he\Nwas taken over by an evil computer virus,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.62,0:16:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and his personality did a 180.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.18,0:16:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.58,0:16:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.58,0:16:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You couldn't be in safer hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.44,0:16:20.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.96,0:16:21.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ditchy-va.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.30,0:16:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How on Ditchy-va, Tim?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.00,0:16:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Togemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.96,0:16:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back to the students with you! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.02,0:16:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.93,0:16:33.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honeybunch, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.60,0:16:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I made a fool of myself, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.72,0:16:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.84,0:16:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the bravest thing I ever saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.82,0:16:41.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.73,0:16:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.65,0:16:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.56,0:16:44.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.56,0:16:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.30,0:16:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mom, Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.64,0:16:53.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to ruin this love fest, but maybe\Nwe should run for cover or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.18,0:16:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.32,0:16:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! It's no use! Save yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.04,0:17:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got it under control, no problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.66,0:17:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.58,0:17:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.68,0:17:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My honest mind will rule the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.74,0:17:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.24,0:17:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now my family's going to\Nsuffer and so are my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.00,0:17:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's got to be something I can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.44,0:17:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions. Digimon, your\Nmonsters. Digimon are the champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.60,0:17:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tokomon, Digiball to...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.28,0:17:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digiball, into ultimate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.72,0:17:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lillymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.18,0:17:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd she come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.30,0:18:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flower cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.42,0:18:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.34,0:18:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just little old me.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.60,0:18:17.61,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1\c&HD494F5&}Lilimon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.60,0:18:17.61,Sign,,370,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.60,0:18:17.61,Sign,,370,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Data
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.60,0:18:17.61,Sign,,370,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Fairy Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.60,0:18:17.61,Sign,,370,0,305,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.60,0:18:17.61,Sign,,370,0,345,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Flower Cannon
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.30,0:18:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or should I say little old us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.54,0:18:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Palmon and Tokomon too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.54,0:18:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is just my fully digivolved form.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.72,0:18:17.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can call me Lillymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.68,0:18:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I in bad taste?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.24,0:18:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.24,0:18:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I ever said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.56,0:18:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No biggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.18,0:18:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to be quicker than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.64,0:18:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.02,0:18:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your wish to save your family and\Nfriends brought me into existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.88,0:18:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, you're a very special girl, even\Nthough your wardrobe sometimes clashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.10,0:18:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.56,0:18:41.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.56,0:18:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now I have a dinosaur to tame.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.44,0:18:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My flower reef counteracted\Nthe evil computer virus,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.54,0:18:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so he ought to be as gentle\Nas a lamb from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.48,0:18:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nicely run him on. That-a-boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.72,0:18:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.80,0:19:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.66,0:19:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back to the digital world with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.22,0:19:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such a bad sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.44,0:19:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, meddlesome little flower child,\Nit's time I plucked your petals.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.10,0:19:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crimson lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.68,0:19:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flower Cannon!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.05,0:19:19.09,Sign,,0,300,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Canal Cruise
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.05,0:19:19.09,Sign,,0,300,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Next ship for departure:
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.05,0:19:19.09,Sign,,0,300,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}NONE
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.05,0:19:19.09,Sign,,300,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Kasai
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.44,0:19:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please bear with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.54,0:19:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.64,0:19:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What made me think the boats would\Nbe running when nothing else is?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.50,0:19:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could be worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.56,0:19:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could be stuck in some crazy...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.02,0:19:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop saying it could be worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.72,0:19:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have news for you, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.92,0:19:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.83,0:19:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole world is stuck in turmoil,\Nand we're waiting for a ride into town.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.84,0:19:36.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We might as well just give up right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.60,0:19:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I wouldn't go that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.34,0:19:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, it could be worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.80,0:19:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.56,0:19:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe if I can just get\Nto that satellite dish.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.90,0:19:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you okay agumon i felt better time huh
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.62,0:20:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up here matt is that you hey we gotta talk
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.80,0:20:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you feel any better a lot better thanks\Nkari what you're kidding me No, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.20,0:20:12.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari's the eighth child.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.20,0:20:14.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.62,0:20:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That new age cycle babble won't help you\Nwhere you're going, my pretty little miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.38,0:20:20.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seize her!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.56,0:20:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take her away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.94,0:20:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.34,0:20:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?! Boo! Boo! Boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.58,0:20:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.94,0:20:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just a bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.48,0:20:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A large bird, I grant you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.98,0:20:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A large angry bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.88,0:20:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.54,0:20:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.48,0:20:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no time now, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.34,0:20:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.92,0:20:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.83,0:20:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.64,0:20:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.86,0:20:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.28,0:20:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.54,0:21:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,FUTURE.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.54,0:21:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,FUTURE
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.56,0:21:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.26,0:21:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give you one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.48,0:21:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be strong for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.70,0:21:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to fly with my courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.90,0:21:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to open my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.56,0:21:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to see my future.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.10,0:23:03.06,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}Break Through the Barrier! Zudomon Spark!

